You don't have to limit your use of this software for commercial purposes to a thirty-day trial period, as long as you don't use it for any [Resale](#resale). You may use, copy, change, and run this software for free, without a time limit, to operate your own business, including providing your own services to your own customers or clients.

## Resale

This additional permission doesn't cover, and you must not without a separate written license from the contributor:

1. sell, rent, lease, license, or sublicense this software, or any changed version of it, for a fee or other payment;

2. offer this software, or any changed version of it, to others as a paid hosted, managed, or software-as-a-service product where access to the software itself is what you charge for; or

3. bundle this software, or any changed version of it, into another product that you sell, where this software provides a substantial part of that product's value.

Sharing copies of this software, with or without changes, for free, with the text of this license and these lines, is not Resale.

